# Historical reference boundary

The exact previous file is retained at `legacy_final_snapshot/evaluation/verified_computation_reference.md.snapshot`. It describes the old scalar scope only and is NOT an expanded reference.

Old fixed isolated-AD dipole and force check are molecular calibration only. They contain no current, electrode self-energy, transmission or finite-bias convergence. The prior scalar target is removed. Source optimized coordinates remain private and cannot prove independent device construction.

Current status: needs_work; implemented_pending_transport_pilot_and_expanded_reference. See `reference_validation_plan.md` and `task_provenance/source_review.json`. No scientifically accepted finite-bias transport reference is available; electrode pilot execution and convergence review are tracked separately.
